  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "wps: Simplify logic to prevent future null pointer dereference",
  "description": "If that default actually is reached, and fmt stays NULL on a fields with\na strings entry, that leads to a null pointer dereference. That doesn't\nhappen with any of the existing fields, but would if, e.g., a signed\ninteger field was added without adding the logic. Straighten out the logic\nso that a null pointer dereference could never happen in then future,\nwhich also makes Coverity happy.\n\nCoverity 1604183",
  "state": "merged",
