      "title": "wps: Simplify logic to prevent future null pointer dereference",
      "message": "wps: Simplify logic to prevent future null pointer dereference\n\nIf the default actually is reached, and fmt stays NULL on a field\nthat has a strings entry, that leads to a null pointer dereference.\nThat doesn't happen with any existing fields that are registered,\nbut it's better to clean up the logic. We only want to append anything\nat all if fmt is not NULL, and that will only happen if hf_info is\nnot NULL, so move around the tests.\n\nCoverity 1604183\n",
